{"pageid": 434, "title": "Miquel Muerto", "revid": 986, "categories": ["Crew"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Miquel Muerto</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/6/69/Miquel_Muerto.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241026065804\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Miquel Muerto\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/6/69/Miquel_Muerto.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241026065804\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/6/69/Miquel_Muerto.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241026065804 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/6/69/Miquel_Muerto.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20241026065804 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Miquel Muerto\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"Miquel_Muerto.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Miquel Muerto.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"role\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Role</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Colorist</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Miquel Muerto</b> is a Spanish comic book colorist for the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i> comic series and its <a href=\"/wiki/Slaughterverse\" title=\"Slaughterverse\">Slaughterverse</a> spinoffs.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Biography\">Biography</span></h2>\n<p>Miquel Muerto studied graphic design first and illustration late, both at EASD Escola Superior de Disseny i Art \"Llotja”. Afterward, he started running a small press with friends doing zines while working as a graphic designer and illustrator for a few years. <i>La Senda de los Druidas</i> (Sallybooks, 2016) was his comic artist debut.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/5/5f/Website.png/revision/latest?cb=20230223192639\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Website\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/5/5f/Website.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20230223192639\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Website.png\" data-image-key=\"Website.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://pollomuerto.com\">Miquel Muerto's official site</a></li></ul>\n<ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Twitter\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/f/f7/Twitter.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20230223192640\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Twitter.png\" data-image-key=\"Twitter.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <span class=\"plainlinks\">Follow <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://twitter.com/pollomuerto\">Miquel Muerto (@pollomuerto)</a></span> on <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://Twitter.com\">Twitter</a></span></li></ul>\n<ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://instagram.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Instagram\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/b/b7/Instagram.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20230223192640\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Instagram.png\" data-image-key=\"Instagram.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <span class=\"plainlinks\">Follow  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://instagram.com/pollomuerto\">Miquel Muerto (@pollomuerto)</a> on <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://instagram.com\">Instagram</a></span></span></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://pollomuerto.com/about\">PolloMuerto.com – About Me</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>", "fetched_at": "2026-10-28T22:43:01+00:00"}